Cell["\<\
This function is submitted together with KS2sample as a companion entry; the \
two share the kuiperks helper. If the WFR requires each submission to be \
fully self-contained, the kuiperks definition should be included in both \
definition cells. The paper by Dimitrova, Jia, Kaishev is to appear in \
Journal of Statistical Computation and Simulation.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules->{},
 CellEventActions->{Inherited, {"KeyDown", "\t"} :> Replace[SelectionMove[
       SelectedNotebook[], After, Cell]; NotebookFind[
       SelectedNotebook[], "TabNext", Next, CellTags, AutoScroll -> True, 
